i kehancuran. \n\nKarena sekarang ragna diharuskan untuk berbagi kehidupannya dengan seseorang yang ditakdirkan mengalami nasib buruk membuat ragna juga ikut terseret kedalamnya, jadi bisakah dia mengubah takdir dunia ini, dan hidup berdua dengan tenang bersama alicia?","year":2024,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Comedy","Adventure","Isekai","Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/4bf066dc-3a6d-4c33-997b-6033208c4176/a9673694-fdc7-4216-8fa5-eca8b9ceafa2.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","pt-br","es-la","vi","id","tr"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.64,"follows":109340,"listAt":"2026-10-19T11:04:56.229Z","chapters":[{"id":"e44bd37e-5088-4eb7-b07f-065ffe76fb53","number":"19","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":33,"createdAt":"2026-10-12T14:24:41+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0527c767-a088-417d-bfeb-f04563f5e4cd","number":"18","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":"2026-09-15T14:49:17+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0cd7e2c6-6ece-4e0e-9006-3e1177c55a93","number":"17","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2026-07-25T04:34:25+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"9fc2b02a-631b-4a53-956f-ea8704059c52","number":"16","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2026-06-14T12:17:21+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"827929df-e71b-480e-9ecd-e699a2deb67c","number":"15","volume":"3","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":30,"createdAt":"2026-05-24T13:09:58+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"2385e2e5-dd52-467d-ab55-f8b1df7ee309","number":"15","volume":"3","title":"Bersama dengan Tunanganku dan Sahabatnya yang Tak Tergantikan... Kami Kembali ke Wilayah Brave!","lang":"id","pages":31,"createdAt":"2026-03-28T12:48:43+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"771a929b-b601-47a1-a4e4-a2ddb3ae6a04","number":"14","volume":"3","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2026-05-23T12:38:21+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ed869cc7-